<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untuk Ida Ayu Bintang Greysha Mey Amora ❤️</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe6eb 0%, #def3ff 100%);
            color: #4a4a4a;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #e63946;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #d62828;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        p {
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .letter-box {
            background: #fff5f6;
            border-left: 4px solid #e63946;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: left;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .gallery {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 10px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .gallery-item {
            background: #f0f0f0;
            height: 120px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #888;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border: 2px dashed #ffb7c5;
        }

        .coupons {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .coupon-card {
            background: #fff;
            border: 2px dashed #e63946;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #d62828;
        }

        .btn-group {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 25px;
            position: relative;
            min-height: 50px;
        }

        button {
            padding: 12px 25px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn-yes {
            background-color: #2a9d8f;
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(42, 157, 143, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-yes:hover {
            background-color: #21867a;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .btn-no {
            background-color: #e63946;
            color: white;
            position: absolute;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.3);
        }

        #response-msg {
            display: none;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: #e8f5e9;
            color: #2e7d32;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Hai, Ida Ayu Bintang Greysha Mey Amora ❤️</h1>
        <p><i>Ada pesan tulus dari Rafly buat kamu...</i></p>

        <div class="letter-box">
            <p><b>Sayangku Amora,</b></p>
            <p>Aku minta maaf yang sebesar-besarnya ya atas kelakuan aku kemarin. Gara-gara aku begadang seharian terus bablas tidur seharian tanpa ngabarin kamu sama sekali, aku udah bikin kamu khawatir, kecewa, dan ditinggal sendirian.</p>
            <p>Aku tahu kamu berhak banget marah dan <i>badmood</i>. Aku nyesel banget gak mikirin perasaan kamu pas itu. Aku takut banget kalau kamu sampai ngerasa gak suka lagi sama aku gara-gara kecerobohan aku ini.</p>
            <p>Aku janji bakal perbaiki pola tidur aku dan bakal selalu mengabari kamu dalam keadaan apapun. Tolong maafin aku ya, Sayang... 🥺</p>
        </div>

        <h2>🎟️ Kupon Permintaan Maaf (Bisa Kamu Klaim Kapan Aja!)</h2>
        <div class="coupons">
            <div class="coupon-card">🎁 Kupon 1: Dibelikan Makanan/Minuman Favorit Kamu</div>
            <div class="coupon-card">🗣️ Kupon 2: Bebas Marahin & Omelin Rafly Sepuasnya</div>
            <div class="coupon-card">🍿 Kupon 3: Jalan-Jalan & Nonton Film Pilihan Kamu</div>
        </div>

        <h2>Maafin Rafly Enggak? 🥺</h2>
        <div class="btn-group">
            <button class="btn-yes" onclick="forgive()">Maafin ❤️</button>
            <button class="btn-no" id="btn-no" onmouseover="moveButton()">Enggak 😜</button>
        </div>

        <div id="response-msg">
            🎉 Makasih banyak ya Sayang! Janji deh Rafly gak bakal gitu lagi. I love you so much, Ida Ayu! ❤️✨
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function moveButton() {
            const btnNo = document.getElementById('btn-no');
            const x = Math.random() * (window.innerWidth - btnNo.offsetWidth - 40);
            const y = Math.random() * (window.innerHeight - btnNo.offsetHeight - 40);
            btnNo.style.position = 'fixed';
            btnNo.style.left = x + 'px';
            btnNo.style.top = y + 'px';
        }

        function forgive() {
            document.getElementById('response-msg').style.display = 'block';
            document.querySelector('.btn-group').style.display = 'none';
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
